RESPONSIBLE USE GUIDELINES

This software is a general-purpose encoding and decoding utility.

PERMITTED USE
  - Encoding and decoding data in any legitimate application
  - Security research, CTF competitions, and educational exercises
  - Analysing encoded content in logs, network traffic, or malware samples
    on systems you are authorised to examine

RESPONSIBLE REMINDER
  Encoding is not encryption.  Data encoded with Base64, hex, or any other
  format in this tool is NOT secure and should NOT be used as a substitute
  for encryption when confidentiality is required.

  Do not use this tool to encode data for the purpose of evading security
  controls on systems you do not have permission to access.
